              "a11yShowSolution": "Show the solution. The task will be marked with its correct solution.",
              "a11yRetry": "Retry the task. Reset all responses and start the task over again.",
              "textField": "The sample can be viewed under a microscope within minutes of arriving at the laboratory. This enables a quick initial report, such as ‘Gram positive cocci seen’, to be telephoned to the clinician if necessary. Combined with an accurate clinical picture, this may be enough to initiate targeted treatment. That process is called *Microscopy* \nA sample from the original culture is grown to create a pure sample to enable further identification of an organism in a process called *Culture*.\nA pure culture is seeded onto an agar plate containing discs saturated with various antibiotics. If the organism grows up to a disc it is resistant to that antibiotic; if there is a clear zone around the disc, it is susceptible. That process is called *Sensitivity*"
            },
